# Interface language (UI)

Read [`docs/interface-language.md`](../../docs/interface-language.md) and [`frontend/design/language.ts`](../../frontend/design/language.ts).

- Project **meanings**, not colours. Decision · Interaction · Water — not burgund · citrus · blue.
- Identity = rhythm, spacing, typography, behaviour, tone — not a palette.
- Max **two active signal** meanings per screen.
